   "textLength": 1187,
   "text": "Java and JDK﻿\nCommon issues with Java:\nSome tools may not find a Java version to run or use a wrong version. To solve this:\nSet the JAVA_HOME environment variable to the directory where the appropriate JDK is installed.\nnote\nWe recommend using JetBrains Runtime, an OpenJDK fork that supports class redefinition.\nAppend the path to the bin folder inside your JAVA_HOME to the PATH variable, so that t",
